{
  "$comment": [
    "The declarative tool catalog `dotf tools` reads (CLI-029). Each entry:",
    "  name, version (the pin, a floor), profile, source.",
    "",
    "source.type picks how the tool arrives:",
    "  github-release  a checksummed release asset (asset per GOOS or GOOS/GOARCH, checksums)",
    "  npm             a global npm package (package)",
    "  uv-tool         a `uv tool install` PyPI package (package)",
    "  system          a package the OS manager owns, for what no cross-OS channel carries:",
    "                    apt / brew / winget  the package name per manager (linux / darwin / windows);",
    "                                         a manager with no name skips the entry on that OS",
    "                    cask                 a Homebrew cask (GUI app, font) instead of a brew formula;",
    "                                         darwin only, never beside brew in one entry. A dotf older",
    "                                         than the reader REFUSES the key (the whole catalog fails to",
    "                                         load), so no cask entry ships before that release is the pin",
    "                    command              optional: the executable it puts on PATH; found there,",
    "                                         the entry is satisfied whichever channel installed it",
    "                  A system entry has no version: it is not pinned, presence is what converges,",
    "                  and it is never upgraded. A dotf that predates the type skips it with a warning,",
    "                  so no system entry was added before a release carrying the reader was the pin (0.65.0).",
    "",
    "source.platforms (every type) narrows an entry to the listed GOOS values."
  ],
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "sops",
      "version": "3.13.1",
      "profile": "full",
      "source": {
        "type": "github-release",
        "repo": "getsops/sops",
        "asset": {
          "linux": "sops-v{version}.linux.{goarch}",
          "darwin": "sops-v{version}.darwin.{goarch}",
          "windows": "sops-v{version}.{goarch}.exe"
        },
        "checksums": "sops-v{version}.checksums.txt"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "mise",
      "version": "2026.9.13",
      "profile": "full",
      "source": {
        "type": "github-release",
        "repo": "jdx/mise",
        "asset": {
          "linux/amd64": "mise-v{version}-linux-x64",
          "linux/arm64": "mise-v{version}-linux-arm64",
          "darwin/amd64": "mise-v{version}-macos-x64",
          "darwin/arm64": "mise-v{version}-macos-arm64",
          "windows/amd64": "mise-v{version}-windows-x64.exe",
          "windows/arm64": "mise-v{version}-windows-arm64.exe"
        },
        "checksums": "SHASUMS256.txt",
        "platforms": ["linux", "darwin"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "opencode",
      "version": "1.16.2",
      "profile": "full",
      "source": {
        "type": "npm",
        "package": "opencode-ai"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "copilot",
      "version": "1.0.81",
      "profile": "full",
      "source": {
        "type": "npm",
        "package": "@github/copilot"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "bw",
      "version": "2026.5.0",
      "profile": "full",
      "source": {
        "type": "npm",
        "package": "@bitwarden/cli"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "yarn",
      "version": "1.22.22",
      "profile": "full",
      "source": {
        "type": "npm",
        "package": "yarn"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "hive",
      "version": "4.2.2",
      "profile": "full",
      "source": {
        "type": "uv-tool",
        "package": "hive-vault",
        "platforms": ["linux", "darwin"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "poetry",
      "version": "2.5.1",
      "profile": "full",
      "source": {
        "type": "uv-tool",
        "package": "poetry"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "gh",
      "profile": "full",
      "source": {
        "type": "system",
        "apt": "gh",
        "brew": "gh",
        "winget": "GitHub.cli",
        "command": "gh"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "bash",
